[1.36,"o","Choose how unstale reads new release notes (costs are estimates; this repo has 2 technologies):\r\n"]
[1.42,"o","  1) Jev labelling API (JEV_API_KEY) + Vercel AI Gateway (AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY): $0.028 per technology-year · this repo ≈ $0.055 a year, first sync ≈ $0.055 once\r\n"]
[1.48,"o","  2) Jev labelling API (JEV_API_KEY) + Codex plan: $0.018 + 110k Codex tokens ($0.020 at API prices) per technology-year · this repo ≈ $0.036 + 220k Codex tokens a year, first sync ≈ $0.036 + 220k Codex tokens once · results through Codex not measured yet\r\n"]
[1.54,"o","  3) Vercel AI Gateway (AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY): $0.055 per technology-year · this repo ≈ $0.11 a year, first sync ≈ $0.11 once · slightly less complete: ≈ 93% of the best option's breaking-change flags; ≈ 2 more duplicate records per technology-year\r\n"]
[1.6,"o","  4) Codex plan: 590k Codex tokens ($0.075 at API prices) per technology-year · this repo ≈ 1.2M Codex tokens a year, first sync ≈ 1.2M Codex tokens once · results through Codex not measured yet\r\n"]
[1.66,"o","  5) Anthropic (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY): $0.075 per technology-year · this repo ≈ $0.15 a year, first sync ≈ $0.15 once · somewhat less complete: ≈ 90% of the best option's changes (fewer from upgrade guides); ≈ 23 more duplicate records per technology-year\r\n"]
